### Run these from Visual Studio, Rider or VS Code (REST Client). Start the API first.
@host = http://localhost:5209

### 1. No key -> 401, WWW-Authenticate says which header to use
GET {{host}}/api/secret

### 2. Wrong key -> 401 with an error
GET {{host}}/api/secret
X-Api-Key: wrong-key

### 3. Client key -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/secret
X-Api-Key: key-for-client

### 4. Client key on the admin endpoint -> 403
GET {{host}}/api/admin
X-Api-Key: key-for-client

### 5. Admin client key -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/admin
X-Api-Key: key-for-admin-client
